{
  "_comment": [
    "The ranged ladder (#582, per-tier and ranked since #617). Read by tools/ranged_ladder.py for",
    "the generator, the roster tool, tools/restat_ranged_donors.py, rebalance_troops.py and the",
    "RANGED_LADDER_INVERSION / RANGED_DAMAGE_CEILING gates. Every (line, class, tier) the line lists",
    "in `tiers` is a generated item ladder_<line>_<bow|xbow>_t<tier>, a clone of the line's donor",
    "(chosen per band, so tiers in a band share a look) with speed, damage and accuracy set here:",
    "  speed    = speed.tier_base[t] + speed.rank_step * (worst overall rank - overall rank)",
    "  damage   = round(damage[cls][t] * (1 + damage.step[t] * (anchor_rank - damage rank)))",
    "  accuracy = min(max, accuracy.top[t] - accuracy.rank_step * (accuracy rank - 1) (+ crossbow_bonus))",
    "  skill    = max(min, skill.anchor[t] + skill.step[t] * (anchor_rank - overall rank)), the troop's",
    "             Bow or Crossbow, written by rebalance_ranged_ladders.py and matched by rebalance_troops.py",
    "Ranks: position 1 is best; lines may tie. anchor_rank 7 is the Gondor group, standing in for",
    "vanilla's typical culture. donor_stats / ammo_stats restat the Armory's own launchers and ammo",
    "(tools/restat_ranged_donors.py); hero_ceiling caps what a lord or wanderer can carry."
  ],
